B.hb_=new A.qW(12,"Baseline and Control","Baseline the integrated schedule and track engineering progress vs release dates, procurement expediting vs delivery dates, and construction progress vs planned sequence.",B.fH,B.acV,"For NDU Project, the baseline is locked from the Builder page. Variance reporting is then run from the Project Controls dashboards.",B.dgZ)
